Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.33,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.33,0:00:24.12,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.42,0:00:31.67,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.67,0:00:36.34,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.30,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.75,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.75,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has created an idea that was\Nlodged through the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.96,0:02:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time for a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx115\fscy115\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(317,325)}Mysterious Ruins - Holy Stone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.24,0:02:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well, what do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.62,0:02:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the circus is in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.09,0:02:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're Mammothmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.01,0:02:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are no match for\Nour Tusk Crusher attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, Black War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.22,0:02:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a bad boy running away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.30,0:02:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now be a good Digimon and come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know how many control spires\Nit took to create these Mammothmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many was it? Two hundred. Two hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:02:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how powerful they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.02,0:03:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.70,0:03:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't even make a dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a scratch on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.76,0:03:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me I didn't see what I just saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if what you saw was four\Nlarge Mammothmon disintegrating,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I can't tell you that,\Nbecause that's what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a few tricks in the old trough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:03:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I defeat my opponent so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still feel an emptiness inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.38,0:04:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what I do, nothing\Nseems to fill this void.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel so empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emotional, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be feeling empty\Nbecause you have no feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I created you from Control Spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're nothing more\Nthan my little puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love a good puppet show! Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder why you're experiencing this,\Nthese imaginary feelings of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite possible that when the Control\NSpires you were made from fused together,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the leftover programs that weren't\Nbeing used caused this reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Left-over programs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How simple it would all be if I were\Njust another one of your control spire,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a simple creation\Nfrom one control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm complex, made up of many spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or is it still my imagination? Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is an easy way\Nto end your suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.82,0:05:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you propose I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just simply forget about\Nall this feeling nonsense
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and follow orders like\Nyou're supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not take orders from\Nthose inferior to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, Ayora?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't take his feeble bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just to prove I'm superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and feel if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're of no more use to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel to your imaginary heart's discontent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not imagining my turmoil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if what they say is true, then my\Nenemies don't suffer when I destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something, Mammothmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you imagining me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.59,0:06:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another failed plan. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about what's really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Destiny Stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those silly things you keep searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know one that's pretty close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the Destiny\NStone rumors are really true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to find out\Nis to actually destroy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we have nothing better to do. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also have a pretty little spot near\Nhere for a love picnic for two. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you taking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is a Destiny Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't you answer me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.02,0:06:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poor, simple-minded creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How I envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How I envy you, Davis. Look at you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you ever think about is eating,\Nsleeping, and playing video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a simple creature you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of other\Nthings I think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Name one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, lots of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But thinking about them hurts my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, in order to keep my mind as\Nrazor-sharp as it needs to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking a break from thinking\Nto play some video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those games turn your brain\Nto mush, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no one asked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you want, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.22,0:07:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pimple!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.70,0:07:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life as we know it is through!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.02,0:07:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if Matt sees me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so cute and I'm so hideous\Nwith this extra head on my chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll get all grossed out\Nand he'll break up on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, we're not actually\Ndating, but are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.88,0:07:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what did you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.08,0:07:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your undivided attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, who's talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You or that giant zit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a zit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.54,0:07:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure does hit hard. Davis! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody sent you an email.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:08:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Demi Vima, we've got\Nto get to the digital world.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.20,0:08:01.16,email,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\frz327.494\pos(309,250)}Tentomon found Archnemon.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.20,0:08:01.16,email,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\frz327.087\pos(286,265)}Meet at the computer room!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you feel any pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.76,0:08:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tiny flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right in Mammothmon's path.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terror Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why did I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What difference does it make if there's\None more tiny flower in the world or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an ironic twist that\Nthe digital world gave
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:09:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me the crest of kindness\Nafter I've been so cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Minimon, I'm getting\Nan email from Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.82,0:09:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says, sorry to bother you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we thought you'd like to\Nknow that we found Aru Kunemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FYI, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.64,0:09:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.10,0:09:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari spells her name, FYI.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You missed my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Minamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I are very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, besides the obvious,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're a little flower, and I'm the\Nmost powerful Digimon on two worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you are alive,\Nand I am just artificial.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have real feelings,\Nand I can only imagine it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like I imagine this pain in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I care about whether\Na tiny flower lives or dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want to know is where\Nis this empty feeling inside
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of me coming from if I'm\Nnot a true living creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does my heart ache when the\Ntruth is my heart doesn't even exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the Digistone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't Plymouth Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we destroy it, something\Ninteresting might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spirit NATO!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.26,0:10:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Nightmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get him angry, Mummymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or he'll drive you crazy with\Nhis berserk sword attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.04,0:10:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nightmon, I order you to\Ndestroy the Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, you look familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you lost or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.24,0:10:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.20,0:10:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, just being friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Argumon's my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protecting this area is my cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I warp Digivolve, I become Wargremon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.14,0:11:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you also made from\Nthe control spires?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I came from a Digi-Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I have nothing to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't possibly\Nunderstand me whether
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you become WarGreymon or\Nany other real Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I will talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And perhaps you can answer all\Nof the questions that plague me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I didn't know there'd\Nbe a quiz involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.74,0:11:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing? Kendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll ruin his sword that way\Nhe'll never cut through that rock i
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,saw a knife cut through a can on tv\Nonce maybe he's trying to sharpen
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.64,0:11:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his sword on the rock yeah that's\Nit no it isn't oh i feel a great
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.54,0:12:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power coming from the rock it might\Nbe the destiny stone i've heard
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legend tell about destiny stones\Nis that anything like a kidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stone no but it could be just as\Npainful according to rumor if the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,destiny stone is destroyed something\Nterrible will happen to the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi World, oh no! Let's stop it. Right,\Nwe'll go down there. Can you gotta
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let the others know and meet us as\Nsoon as possible hmm maybe right
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here then again. Oh, I'm not sure.\NI'm sorry I'm not more help. You
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but no one's ever asked me before\Nwhere my heart is strange you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,claim to be alive and yet you don't\Nknow where your heart is maybe it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't really exist maybe the heart\Nis just an illusion it's not an
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,illusion when you really care about\Nsomeone more than you care about
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.42,0:12:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself it's called love and I\Nknow it comes from the heart I just
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't know where it is interesting\Nthen Then let me ask you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you have a heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:12:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.76,0:12:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just do, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans have them, and so do Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm a different kind of\NDigimon, made from control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.30,0:13:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean I have a heart, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or was I created without one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are all very good questions\Nthat I'd love to answer for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm not very good\Nat this kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.92,0:13:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you repeat the question?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.14,0:13:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I remember\Nwhat I asked anymore. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we're both confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.38,0:13:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's forget the whole\Nthing and grab a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I need more answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desert Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, X-V-Mom, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, T.K., as long as he\Ndoesn't have another sword, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Equus Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out, it's an ambush!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snake Bending!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spider Thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you for the\Nfirst and last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you see, I'm not alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I possibly have any use\Nfor a heart in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.72,0:14:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.36,0:14:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can be a friend. A friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.46,0:14:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, if you care about\Nme, then we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we're friends,\Nthen you have a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't have one without the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got lots of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I'm not capable of being a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would prove once and for\Nall if I have a heart or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.98,0:14:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you're capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody's capable of\Nbeing someone's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if... What if?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.32,0:14:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always with the what ifs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if my aunt had a mustache?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.66,0:14:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'd be my uncle. She would.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your logic confuses me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is friendship supposed to\Nfeel, or does it just happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, it certainly\Nhasn't made me feel any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's cause we just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.92,0:14:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it time. Time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've given you time to answer all of my\Nquestions, and you haven't answered one yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should just destroy you and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to be my purpose in life,\Nand if that's so, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will dedicate myself to\Nbeing the most powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to know if\Nthat is my true destiny,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or if there's something more for me\Nin this world than just fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know like a reason\Nwhy I'm here for some it's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,money others power and for\Nyou Perhaps friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have to know the\Nreason why I was created
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, are you a serious guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sword won't be any\Nuse against my hard shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.38,0:15:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:15:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.78,0:16:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess my shell's not\Nas strong as I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on! Bust loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is more fun than fishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having a party without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.82,0:16:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiking strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.74,0:16:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go! Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're down to the last of our nine lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-Femo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D.N.A.!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.64,0:16:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon II!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Airdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Airdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D .N .A.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon II!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silphymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.24,0:17:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.32,0:17:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Payback time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not so much fun when\Nyou're on the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call kickin' the can!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.78,0:17:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't throw your heart away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if what you say is\Ntrue, and I have a heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it is clearly\Ninterfering with my fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I can't reach my full fighting\Npotential until I throw my heart away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting is important,\Nbut it's not everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to trust me as your friend\Nbefore you can find your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be your friend in order\Nto prove if my heart exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it doesn't, I will\Nbe forced to destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.18,0:17:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, it's customary to\Nshake hands with a new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.76,0:18:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.67,0:18:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shake hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desert Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please break me the Destiny Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.76,0:18:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.54,0:18:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You... okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.94,0:18:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.38,0:18:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's hurting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.40,0:18:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong\Nwith the Destiny Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going to make floors. Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.08,0:19:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snake Bandit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His attacks just aren't doing a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mummymon, we need to come up\Nwith a new plan of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.40,0:19:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean, uselessly pounding away on\Nthis rock isn't a good plan. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Black War Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's split. I can't deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sure seem to be in a hurry. How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must realize it's\Nuseless to fight us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.10,0:19:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Black War Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.76,0:19:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think he's on our side?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:20:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Destiny Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.89,0:20:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He crushed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.78,0:20:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just no match for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Blackboard, Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cracked!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.04,0:20:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get sucked in! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, everyone, before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this means the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.30,0:20:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Destiny Stone destroyed,\None Digi-World demolished.
